WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.900
Two exams. Four hours each.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.250
One credential that says you can plan,
control, analyse — and decide.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:19.760
Welcome to Certuvo. In the next three minutes:
the CMA, exactly as it stands in 2026.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:29.200
What's in Part 1. What's in Part 2. How the
exam works. How to be ready.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:41.480
Awarded by IMA, the Institute of Management
Accountants, since 1972.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:54.450
The credential for management accounting:
planning, budgeting, performance, risk,
strategy.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:01.000
Part 1 — Financial Planning, Performance and
Analytics. Six domains.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.970
External Financial Reporting Decisions 15% ·
Planning, Budgeting and Forecasting 20% ·
Performance Management 20%

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:19.060
Cost Management 15% · Internal Controls 15% ·
Technology and Analytics 15%

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:25.500
Part 1 is the engine room: how the numbers are
built, budgeted, measured and controlled.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.160
Part 2 — Strategic Financial Management. Six
domains.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:41.320
Financial Statement Analysis 20% · Corporate
Finance 20% · Decision Analysis 25%

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:48.730
Risk Management 10% · Investment Decisions 10%
· Professional Ethics 15%

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:54.470
Part 2 is the boardroom: what the numbers
mean, and what you decide because of them.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:04.350
Each part: 4 hours. 100 multiple-choice
questions in 3 hours — 75% of the score.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:16.830
Then 1 hour: from the September 2026 window,
two case-based questions replace the essays.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:25.970
At least 50% on the multiple choice unlocks
the second section. Pass mark: 360 of 500.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:32.340
Three windows a year: Jan–Feb · May–Jun ·
Sep–Oct

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:44.100
To be certified: IMA membership · a bachelor's
degree or approved certification · 2 years'
relevant experience

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:52.380
The experience can be completed up to 7 years
after passing — so you can sit the exam first.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:03:06.270
IMA Global Salary Survey 2023: CMAs' median
total compensation 21% higher than non-CMAs
worldwide.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:15.000
The roles follow: FP&A · controller · finance
business partner · the route to CFO.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.180
Certuvo prepares you for exactly this exam.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:29.340
Practice exams: scenario-based questions in
the real format · timed quizzes · full-length
mocks.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:35.720
Progress tracking: your strengths, your gaps,
and when you're ready.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:44.610
Live study rooms with your cohort · 24/7 chat
support from experienced mentors.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:57.300
AI Question Forge: unlimited new questions on
any topic, validated by four AI judges.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:07.660
AI Coach: chat or call during practice, in six
languages. It reads your screen.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:13.750
Auto-disabled during mock exams. Practise with
help. Test without it.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:20.860
Pick your part. Choose a testing window. Start
preparing with Certuvo today.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.560
certuvo.com

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:29.390
The exam is hard by design. Being ready for it
doesn't have to be.
